--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Code from room
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Contains code from room (https://github.com/sunsided/room), a Rust port of doomgeneric,
copied at commit 904acac5fb7d89d7545082c3fab71408176d2404 and licensed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2 or later; see LICENSE-GPL-2.0. room in turn derives
from doomgeneric and the id Software Doom source release (GPL-2.0-or-later).

